<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>John Mark Alojado — IT Support & Cybersecurity</title>
<meta name="description" content="Portfolio of John Mark Alojado — BSIT student, IT support and cybersecurity specialist. 7 open-source security tools, systems work, and awarded engineering projects.">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'><text y='.9em' font-size='90'>🛡️</text></svg>">
<style>
:root {
  --bg: #0a0e14;
  --bg2: #0f141c;
  --card: #131a24;
  --border: #1e2836;
  --text: #d6e2f0;
  --muted: #8494ac;
  --accent: #22d3ee;
  --accent2: #a78bfa;
  --green: #34d399;
  --amber: #fbbf24;
  --red: #f87171;
}
* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
body {
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
  line-height: 1.6;
  overflow-x: hidden;
}
a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

/* ---------- nav ---------- */
nav {
  position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;
  background: rgba(10, 14, 20, 0.85);
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding: 0 clamp(1rem, 5vw, 3rem);
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
  height: 60px;
}
.nav-logo { font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); font-size: 1.05rem; letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
.nav-logo span { color: var(--accent); }
nav ul { display: flex; gap: clamp(0.8rem, 2vw, 2rem); list-style: none; }
nav ul a { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.92rem; font-weight: 500; }
nav ul a:hover { color: var(--text); text-decoration: none; }

/* ---------- layout ---------- */
section { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 5.5rem) 1.5rem; }
.tag { color: var(--accent); font-family: 'Cascadia Code', 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 0.82rem; }
h2 { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.5vw, 2.2rem); margin: 0.4rem 0 1.4rem; }
h2 .n { color: var(--muted); font-family: monospace; margin-right: 0.6rem; }

/* ---------- hero ---------- */
#hero {
  min-height: 92vh;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;
  padding-top: 6rem;
  position: relative;
}
#hero::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute; inset: 0;
  background:
    radial-gradient(600px 400px at 85% 15%, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.07), transparent 70%),
    radial-gradient(700px 500px at 10% 85%, rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.07), transparent 70%);
  pointer-events: none;
}
.hero-title { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 4.2rem); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.1; margin: 1rem 0; }
.hero-title .grad {
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), var(--accent2));
  -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
}
.hero-sub { color: var(--muted); font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.2rem); max-width: 640px; }
.hero-badges { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.6rem; margin-top: 1.6rem; }
.badge {
  background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border);
  color: var(--muted); padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem; border-radius: 999px;
  font-size: 0.82rem;
}
.badge b { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }
.hero-cta { display: flex; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 2.2rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.btn {
  display: inline-block; padding: 0.75rem 1.6rem; border-radius: 10px;
  font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95rem; transition: transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
}
.btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); text-decoration: none; }
.btn-primary { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0891b2, #7c3aed); color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.25); }
.btn-ghost { border: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--text); background: var(--card); }

/* ---------- stats ---------- */
.stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
.stat {
  background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px;
  padding: 1.2rem; text-align: center;
}
.stat .num { font-size: 1.9rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--accent); }
.stat .lbl { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }

/* ---------- projects ---------- */
.grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(310px, 1fr)); gap: 1.2rem; }
.card {
  background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 1.5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem;
  transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
}
.card:hover { border-color: #2e3d52; transform: translateY(-3px); }
.card-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.8rem; }
.card-icon {
  width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; flex-shrink: 0;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  font-size: 1.3rem; background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.08);
  border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.15);
}
.card h3 { font-size: 1.08rem; font-weight: 700; }
.card h3 a { color: var(--text); }
.card p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; flex-grow: 1; }
.chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; }
.chip {
  font-size: 0.72rem; padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 999px;
  background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--accent);
  font-family: 'Cascadia Code', monospace;
}
.card-links { display: flex; gap: 1rem; margin-top: auto; padding-top: 0.4rem; }
.card-links a { font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 600; }

/* ---------- experience timeline ---------- */
.timeline { position: relative; padding-left: 1.6rem; border-left: 2px solid var(--border); }
.titem { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
.titem .when { color: var(--accent); font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.8rem; }
.titem h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 0.2rem 0; }
.titem .org { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
.titem ul { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; padding-left: 1.2rem; }
.titem ul li { margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }

/* ---------- skills ---------- */
.skills { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
.skill-cat {
  background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px;
  padding: 1.2rem;
}
.skill-cat h3 { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
.skill-cat ul { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.45rem; }
.skill-cat li {
  background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding: 0.25rem 0.7rem; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text);
}

/* ---------- resume CTA ---------- */
.resume-box {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.06), rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.06));
  border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 18px;
  padding: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.6rem); text-align: center;
}
.resume-box h2 { margin-top: 0; }
.resume-box p { color: var(--muted); max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto 1.6rem; }

/* ---------- footer ---------- */
footer {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--muted);
  text-align: center; padding: 2.2rem 1rem; font-size: 0.85rem;
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  nav ul { gap: 0.9rem; }
  nav ul a { font-size: 0.8rem; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="nav-logo">johnmark<span>.dev</span></div>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="#projects">Projects</a></li>
    <li><a href="#experience">Experience</a></li>
    <li><a href="#skills">Skills</a></li>
    <li><a href="resume.html">Résumé</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://github.com/Diavolo148888" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<!-- ================= HERO ================= -->
<section id="hero">
  <div class="tag">~ $ whoami</div>
  <h1 class="hero-title">John Mark <span class="grad">Alojado</span></h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">
    BSIT student and hands-on IT support & cybersecurity specialist from Baler, Aurora 🇵🇭.
    I build security tooling people actually use — port scanners, phishing detectors,
    log analyzers — and keep the systems around me running.
  </p>
  <div class="hero-badges">
    <div class="badge">🎓 BSIT @ <b>Central Luzon State University</b></div>
    <div class="badge">🛡️ <b>8</b> open-source tools incl. civic tech</div>
    <div class="badge">🏆 Best Innovation Award · 1st Place Division</div>
    <div class="badge">🐧 Linux · Fedora · Docker</div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-cta">
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#projects">View my work →</a>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="resume.html">Read my résumé</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= STATS ================= -->
<section id="stats">
  <div class="stats">
    <div class="stat"><div class="num">8</div><div class="lbl">open-source tools shipped</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="num">137</div><div class="lbl">tests passing across repos</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="num">0</div><div class="lbl">external dependencies</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="num">2</div><div class="lbl">competition awards</div></div>
